                                "sense_id": "00d88600-86a5-33ef-891d-cd405f49600a",
                                "text": "Each new comer was one more recruit to the ranks of ruffianism, and not a man penned in that reeking den of infamy but became a sworn hater of law, order, and “free-men.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ce3ea75-58b4-4baf-b794-329a3b030039",
                                "sense_id": "00d88600-86a5-33ef-891d-cd405f49600a",
                                "text": "A scrubby beard covered his face to the cheekbones, giving him an air of ruffianism that went oddly with his large weak frame and nervous movements."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
